---
layout: base
title: "Topics"
description: "Browse the eight topic paths through the Jai Khyapa Parampara archive: prophecy, guru stories, sacred texts, sadhana, rituals, places, discourses, and philosophy."
metaDescription: "Eight topic paths through the Jai Khyapa Parampara archive of 1,205 articles, from prophecy and guru stories to sacred texts and sadhana."
permalink: /topics/index.html
robotsMeta: "index, follow"
---
<style>
.topics-page{padding-top:2.5rem;padding-bottom:1rem}
.topics-head{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto 2rem;text-align:center}
.topics-eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;padding:.4rem 1rem;border:1px solid var(--border-gold);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(232,196,104,.08);color:var(--accent-color);font-family:'Philosopher',sans-serif;font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
.topics-head h1{font-family:'Philosopher',sans-serif;color:var(--accent-bright);font-size:clamp(2.1rem,4vw,3.1rem);line-height:1.12;margin:1rem 0 .7rem}
.topics-head p{color:var(--text-dark);opacity:.9;font-size:1.08rem;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto}
.topics-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:1rem}
.topics-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem;padding:1.3rem;border:1px solid var(--border-gold);border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(45,15,24,.55),rgba(17,6,9,.94));color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s ease,border-color .2s ease,background .2s ease}
.topics-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:var(--accent-color);background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(232,196,104,.12),rgba(17,6,9,.94))}
.topics-count{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--accent-color);letter-spacing:.03em}
.topics-card h2{font-family:'Philosopher',sans-serif;color:var(--accent-bright);font-size:1.35rem;line-height:1.28;margin:0}
.topics-card p{color:var(--text-dark);opacity:.86;font-size:.98rem;line-height:1.6;margin:0}
.topics-cta{margin-top:auto;padding-top:.6rem;color:var(--accent-color);font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem}
.topics-foot{margin-top:1.6rem;text-align:center;color:var(--text-dark);opacity:.85;font-size:.96rem;line-height:1.7}
.topics-foot a{color:var(--accent-color)}
@media(max-width:600px){.topics-page{padding-top:1.5rem}.topics-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>

<div class="container topics-page">
  <header class="topics-head">
    <span class="topics-eyebrow">Browse the archive</span>
    <h1>Eight paths through the Parampara</h1>
    <p>
      Every one of the 1,205 articles belongs to one of these paths. Each opens a
      complete list of related teachings, arranged by title, so nothing is hidden
      by date.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="topics-grid">
    {% for group in collections.browseGroups %}
    <a class="topics-card" href="{{ group.url }}">
      <span class="topics-count">{{ group.count }} articles</span>
      <h2>{{ group.name }}</h2>
      <p>{{ group.description }}</p>
      <span class="topics-cta">Enter this path &rarr;</span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <p class="topics-foot">
    Looking for one name or phrase? <a href="/tags/">Browse all keywords</a>
    &middot; <a href="/articles/">See every article</a>
  </p>
</div>
